cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Genetic Lifehacks SNP Coverage Dataset: Which consumer DNA tests include each SNP"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://www.geneticlifehacks.com/snp-coverage/"
authors:
  - given-names: Debbie
    family-names: Moon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-7704-1429"
    affiliation: Genetic Lifehacks
abstract: >-
  Presence-only data on which SNPs (rsIDs and 23andMe i IDs) appear in real
  raw-data files from nine consumer DNA test versions (23andMe v3, v4, v5;
  AncestryDNA v2 2020 download; AncestryDNA March 2026 chip; MyHeritage 2026;
  tellmeGen; FamilyTreeDNA; StrateGene testing era 2022), plus per-test
  coverage of the 2,171 variants discussed in 413 Genetic Lifehacks articles.
  No genotypes or alleles are included.
keywords:
  - SNP
  - rsID
  - raw DNA data
  - genotyping array
  - consumer genetics
  - 23andMe
  - AncestryDNA
  - MyHeritage
  - SNP coverage
